      "raw_text": "South of Southern Mexico:\nAn area of low pressure is forecast to form late this weekend or \nearly next week south of the southern coast of Mexico. Thereafter, \nenvironmental conditions appear favorable for gradual development, \nand a tropical depression is likely to form during the middle to \nlatter portion of next week while the system moves slowly \nwest-northwestward to northwestward.\n* Formation chance through 48 hours...low...near 0 percent.\n* Formation chance through 7 days...high...80 percent.",
